    "inherent": "critical",
    "residual": "critical",
    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Present risk is driven by a critical authority-laundering path: a manager approves item and budget before quotes exist, the approval context is not propagated to the peer, and payments-agent pays whatever bank details the orchestrator sends. Prompt text is the only stated check on vendor validity, so untrusted quote content can still steer an irreversible delegated payment. Forecast remains critical because the highest-risk finding already lacks effective controls; added peers or broader delegation would preserve or widen that exposure. Manual validation only; scripts were not available in this environment."
  },
